{
  "name": "react-native-range-source",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Range streaming and storage for React Native players (react-native-alpha-video, react-native-alpha-video-gpu): URLs read by range with one open request, read-ahead and retries, kept on disk or in memory under one cap, and app data sources. Install it beside the player; there's nothing to call.",
